WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.000
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.367
I'm here with Ana de Armas
right here.

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:05.934
That's what I'm talking about.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:10.834
We're about to face off in a new
game called "Backtionary."

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:13.801
-♪ "Backionary" ♪

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:16.601
-Now, this is like
Pictionary with a twist, okay?

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:17.734
Now, I'm going to grab a clue

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:20.467
that I have to draw
on your back, okay?

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.000
I'll put a piece
of paper on your back.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.200
And while I'm drawing,
you try to re-create

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.667
what I'm drawing
on that easel over there,

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:29.067
while you're
guessing what I'm drawing.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:31.167
-Okay.
-Okay? Are you ready for this?

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.334
-Mm-hmm.
-Let's try Round 1.

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.634
Audience, clue?
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.234
-Wow.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:38.234
I like that.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:41.267
Alright.

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.801
Okay. I think we can do this.

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:45.801
Alright, turn around.
I will put -- I will put this --

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:47.901
-Should I get this one?
Oh, I have the big one here.

00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:49.033
-Yeah, you'll have
the good marker there.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:52.467
Okay. Ready?

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:54.067
-Oh, my God.

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:59.100
-Alright, are you ready, bud?

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.601
I think this is
gonna be -- Okay.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.901
Ready? Here we go.
-Wait. Slow, slow, slow.

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:04.567
-Yeah. Yeah.
I haven't started yet.

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:06.801
♪♪

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:22.267
-Oh.
-Yes.

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:25.968
How much time?
-That?

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:27.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes. What do you think?

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:29.033
What's your guess?

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:31.968
-Is it a -- It's a --
I don't know -- a --

00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:33.701
[ Buzzer ]
-Yes. What does that look like?

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.601
That's fantastic.
Better than what I drew.

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:39.100
This -- yours is better
than what I drew.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.200
[ Laughter ]
I don't know what I drew.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.467
[ Dinging ]
Lightning bolt.

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:43.734
-Lightning bolt.
♪♪

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:46.033
-Oh, you would have got that.
-Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.133
-It's thunder and
lightning bolt, right?

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:48.133
That was good.
-Yeah.

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:49.334
That's good.
Alright, now -- Alright.

00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:50.567
-Okay.
-Let's try again.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:51.801
Tariq, what are you laughing at?

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:53.734
-Because she -- How is hers
better than the --

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:56.100
-It doesn't matter.
It doesn't matter.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.701
It doesn't matter. Whatever.

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:00.300
It was the first round.
Okay, what clue should she pick?

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.300
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.501
-Six. Six?

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:09.267
-Alright, I'm not gonna look.

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:10.701
-Oh.

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:12.300
-I'm not looking, not looking.
No cheating, no cheating.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.767
I'm not looking.

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:14.968
-I like it.
-Yeah?

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.100
-Yeah.
-Okay. Okay.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.367
-Okay.
-We got this?

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:18.434
-Yeah. Yeah.
-Okay.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:20.067
♪♪

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:24.968
Wait. What? Do it again?
Sorry.

00:02:24.968 --> 00:02:26.934
-Sorry, sorry.
-Sorry. Do it again.

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:28.067
Wow.

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:35.901
-How -- [ Laughs ]

00:02:35.901 --> 00:02:37.434
How are you feeling that?

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:39.400
-I have --
I'm feeling fantastic.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.868
I don't know
what I'm feeling right now.

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:47.934
Uh...

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.567
I don't know.

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:50.868
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:53.267
Ooh, wow!
-Wait! I'm not done.

00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:55.367
-Oh, well,
I think one of us is --

00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:57.000
I think -- Wait.
Do it one more time.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.767
Yes.

00:03:00.767 --> 00:03:02.701
I think there's a heart
on there.

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:05.501
I don't know what it is.
I'm going to say a clock?

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:10.067
A clock. Was I remotely close?
I got lost.

00:03:10.067 --> 00:03:11.701
Oh, it was a butterfly.

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:13.534
A much nicer thing.
I'm sorry.

00:03:13.534 --> 00:03:16.200
I should have gotten that.
-You're covering your --

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.434
-Mine was terrible.

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:20.501
[ Air horn blows ]
Ooh!

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:21.667
You know what that sound means.

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.501
It means it's time
for the final round.

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:25.200
Okay, we're going to
shake things up here.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.267
Quest, you want to give me
a hand over here?

00:03:26.267 --> 00:03:27.334
-Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:27.334 --> 00:03:32.634
-Now, for this round,
we're playing

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:34.634
"Triple Backtionary."

00:03:34.634 --> 00:03:39.601
Ana, you will draw on my back
and I will draw on Quest's back

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:41.234
and then he will draw
on his easel.

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:45.100
If he guesses what we're
trying to draw, we all win.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:47.868
-It'll be a miracle.
-Wait. Yeah.

00:03:47.868 --> 00:03:49.534
-It will be a miracle.
Exactly right.

00:03:49.534 --> 00:03:50.801
-Okay.
-Ana, pick a clue.

00:03:50.801 --> 00:03:52.267
What do you guys think?
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:56.601
-Ten?

00:03:58.133 --> 00:03:59.667
Okay.
-Okay, that's you.

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:01.501
No, you got that -- Oh.
-Okay.

00:04:01.501 --> 00:04:03.133
-Alright.
[ Audience "Awws" ]

00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:04.200
Whoa. Okay. Wait.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.300
-They said, "Aww."
-Yeah, I know.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.367
It must be like
a puppy or something.

00:04:08.367 --> 00:04:10.033
Okay. Okay.

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:11.234
-Alright.
-Alright.

00:04:11.234 --> 00:04:13.868
Ana, I'm trusting you on this.
Yep.

00:04:13.868 --> 00:04:15.467
-I mean, you can't
get this wrong.

00:04:15.467 --> 00:04:16.734
-Oh.

00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:18.667
♪♪

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.234
-Oh.

00:04:24.234 --> 00:04:26.567
-Are we done?
-You got to do it...

00:04:26.567 --> 00:04:29.200
Wait. Are you doing it?
-I don't know.

00:04:38.133 --> 00:04:40.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:41.734
-Wait. Do it again!
Do it again! Do it again!

00:04:41.734 --> 00:04:43.100
-I'm done.
-No, no. -- You --

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:45.701
Quest, no.
Quest, what are you doing?

00:04:45.701 --> 00:04:47.367
-I'm doing what you're doing?
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:49.434
-What the heck
are you drawing, dude?

00:04:49.434 --> 00:04:51.801
What are you drawing?
-No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:04:51.801 --> 00:04:53.501
Do it again. Do it again.
-One more time. One more time.

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:54.501
Do it again.

00:04:54.501 --> 00:04:56.067
-I mean, mine is
pretty bad, too.

00:04:56.067 --> 00:04:57.467
-Go.
-Okay.

00:04:57.467 --> 00:04:59.934
♪♪

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:05.634
Oh.

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:08.701
Oh. Oh.

00:05:08.701 --> 00:05:10.133
Oh, wait, wait.

00:05:10.133 --> 00:05:12.100
Is it that?

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.467
-Yes.

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:16.767
-Well, I do more -- Yeah, mine
is different, but, yes,

00:05:16.767 --> 00:05:19.934
that's the idea.

00:05:19.934 --> 00:05:23.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:38.567
[ Dinging ]

00:05:38.567 --> 00:05:43.400
-Whoo-hoo-hoo!
♪♪

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.567
-It was sun.

00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:46.801
-Oh!
-Sun!

00:05:46.801 --> 00:05:47.901
-Yes.

00:05:47.901 --> 00:05:49.200
-I thought you were
doing a flower.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.634
-Okay.
-That's not a good sun.

00:05:50.634 --> 00:05:52.501
-"Questlove
has a new book out now."

00:05:52.501 --> 00:05:53.501
There you go right there.

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:55.767
So he's the winner is Questlove.

00:05:55.767 --> 00:05:57.767
Ana's new movie --
Ana de Armas --

00:05:57.767 --> 00:06:00.934
